Third-party components

oonfeeWRT incorporates the Go runtime and standard library, third-party Go
packages, third-party JavaScript packages in its embedded production UI, and
Alpine's Mozilla-derived CA certificate bundle. The exact shipped versions,
provenance, copyright notices, and license texts are recorded in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES, generated from pinned or locked source material.

Nothing in this repository is copied from OpenWrt, LuCI, or any vendor
firmware. Where the documentation quotes ACL fragments or ubus method names,
those are interface facts about the system being managed — the shape of an API
we call — not copied implementation.
